{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This release is constituted after the recent release of the amendments to the Issue of International Security."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This circular confirms the full leadership of the Continental Security Agency under the Personnel and Leadership Framework: the Cabinet and its Senior Counsel, the leadership of the twelve Cabinet departments, and the leadership of the CSA Judicial Service Commission and the Judiciary."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In each department, the Secretary leads the department, each Secretary of State leads one policy, each Deputy Secretary leads one part of a policy, and the Executive Director heads the career service of the department through the CSA Human Resources Commission."
    },
