    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "International Intelligence Council"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The International Intelligence Council consists of two branches: the Intermediary Council, made up of the Senior Counsel of the Cabinet in terms of the IIC, and the Distinctive Council."
