      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Marcus Wagner, Philip Meier, Andreas Maurer, Sandra Barth, Ralph Schwartz, Bernd Gerste and Stefanie Eberhart continue as Justices of the International Court of Justice. The leadership of the International Court of Justice, and the leadership and bench of the International Criminal Court, will be determined by the CSA Judicial Service Commission."
