      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This circular takes effect on the date of issue and supersedes every earlier list of CSA leadership. All departments, agencies, commissions and offices of the Continental Security Agency shall address correspondence and official business to the office holders named in this circular. Enquiries should be directed to the Office of the Director."
